  "description": "⭐ <em>After captivating audiences worldwide with Peter Pan, Ballet of Lights presents Cinderella! This classic fairy tale is reimagined in a ballet show where dancers shine in glow-in-the-dark costumes. Get your tickets for </em><strong><em>Ballet of Lights: Cinderella in a Sparkling Show</em></strong><em> in London!</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n👠 Cinderella reimagined in a spectacular ballet show<br>\n🎶 A beautiful soundtrack with songs from some of the greatest classical composers<br>\n🌟 Four talented dancers bring the story to life in illuminated costumes<br>\n🩰 A new kind of theatre show—classical dance with a contemporary twist<br>\n👪 A magical experience to be enjoyed with family and friends<br>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.feverup.com/m/501845\">Ballet of Lights</a> here<br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n📍 Location: Shaw Theatre, London<br>\n⏳ Duration: approx. 60 minutes (doors open 30 mins prior to the start time, late entry is not permitted, and there is no interval)<br>\n🪑 Seat Allocation: <span>Seat numbers will be auto allocated within each zone following purchase. For group bookings, please purchase in one transaction to ensure you are seated together. We do recommend you arrive early to get comfortable!</span><br>\n👤 Age requirement: 5+. Children under 16 must be accompanied by an adult<br>\n♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\n❓ For more information, please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQBOwKQpT56uZ6CYxkm8TL7VKQns7HEHrV68PefMMtSW_c_4vvaeWbSqmaek5dgDUNRlhhjJ7kkx9Oq/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n✨ If you would like to book a private show or buy tickets for a large group (30+ people), <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:groupbooking@feverup.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">click here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nCinderella returns in a bold, new ballet that’s redefining classical dance. Watch as dancers in illuminated costumes twirl and glow across the stage, breathing new life into this beloved fairytale. Whether it’s the hilarious antics of the evil stepsisters, the opulence of the Royal Ball, or the heartwarming romance between the Prince and Cinderella, each magical moment is brought to life through dance, colour, and light. Be part of the magic—get your tickets for <em>Ballet of Lights: Cinderella in a Sparkling Show</em> in London!<br>\n&nbsp;\n<center><strong>Seating Map</strong><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/e362f7b4-6d8f-11f0-87a3-6e6a5cc0bb0a.png\" width=\"290px\"></center>",
